WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
It doesn't look like he's faking it

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:04,420
I really have never met people in today’s society.

3
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:06,180
But he looks really handsome

4
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:12,520
Boss, I want some rice. The cheapest rice is 10,000 kilograms. Very good.

5
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,560
Boss, where to put it?

6
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:14,560
There's no one here

7
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:17,120
There's an alley over there and there's no one there, so put it there for me.

8
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:27,560
Okay, I'll arrange for someone to wait. Why is this oil selling for forty-five yuan a barrel? Give me ten barrels. Is this sugar? Yes, it's three dollars and a pound. Give me a hundred pounds. What is this called instant noodles? Don't you recognize it? What's going on with this guy?

9
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:31,480
Why do you feel so stupid? Do you eat instant noodles? Yes, otherwise, how do you eat them?

10
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,560
I have too little knowledge, right?

11
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:38,740
If you tear this thing open, there will be noodles and dry ingredients inside, right, right, right?

12
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:44,700
You can call it dry quantity. It's 3.5 yuan per box. I'll give it a try with 3 barrels. I'll pack it for you.

13
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:46,420
A total of twenty-three thousand one hundred yuan

14
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:48,860
Just give me twenty-three thousand, okay?

15
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:56,460
I'll arrange for you to be sent back to the alley right away. That's great.
